Subject: set StartupWMClass to the Wayland app_id org.kde.kasts

Kasts takes its app_id from KAboutData, which derives org.kde.kasts, the
desktop file name; upstream's class names no window Kasts opens.

--- a/org.kde.kasts.desktop
+++ b/org.kde.kasts.desktop
@@ -151,4 +151,4 @@
 InitialPreference=10
 X-KDE-FormFactor=desktop;tablet;handset;
 StartupNotify=true
-StartupWMClass=kasts
+StartupWMClass=org.kde.kasts
